{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956070/extras/e989e846219fbf3fb16b582ab6dbbd42.avif?t=1772417802\" width=780 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaf, a female knight serving as the princess\u2019s bodyguard, visits the island of Trion \u2014 a tourist spot known for its ancient ruins.<br>However, due to a small mishap and the schemes of the succubi who manage the island, she ends up having to conquer a dungeon filled with traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Leaf be able to reach Princess Marika, who awaits deep within the island?<br>Before the eyes of countless spectators, the challenge of the knight and the princess begins...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956070/extras/6b2e90caa04c90725e464434ef24e30d.avif?t=1772417802\" width=780 height=67 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the knight Leaf, who sets out to rescue the princess being held as a spectacle deep within the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to traverse and overcome the trap-filled island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and various rich events will be fully depicted through the dual perspectives of Leaf and the island\u2019s administrator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956070/extras/a539a5ee349f5c773f5687b04c392944.avif?t=1772417802\" width=780 height=67 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and detailed CG artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 5~10 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956070?t=1